  "description": "deadmau5 has always looked to harness the power of technology in his shows. While his progressive, big-room tunes provide the soundtrack, his headline events are a multi-sensory experience with mind-blowing visuals.\n\nHe has also long been tuned into live production, streaming, gaming, software and heightened digital experiences, and in the last 12 months has combined all that with shows at Red Rocks Amphitheatre in Colorado, Las Vegas, and at the Nashville Superspeedway race track. His long-awaited new studio album has been teased with lead singles ‘Ameonna’ and ‘Science’, a 10-minute collaboration with Stevie Appleton that has a grand emotional swell and widescreen progressive grooves.",
